# The Prolog backend's preset: the backend and the native typing of the types
# it represents, enabled together as one module (CONTRIBUTING.md, "Efficiency by design, with native structures"):
# a native typing serves only where the backend represents the type.
#
# A typing module is a knowledge file whose lemmas write a filter `x ∥ T`, T
# a type the backend represents natively, or derive such filters: the
# schemes of native_types (`zero + (zero ∥ nat_type)` and the others) and of
# native_arithmetic, and the type check of hindley_milner_unions and
# native_arithmetic_unions. The backend is prolog_backend (the codecs of
# nat_type and boolean_type), native_arithmetic_prolog_backend (the natives
# of double and even) and prolog_backend_shapes (the candidacy of the
# representations, the typed versions and their contracts). An entry
# enables native typing only through a preset, never by importing a typing
# module of its own.
# TODO: a law over the tree's lambdalattice files checks that no file but a
# preset imports a module a preset imports; it is committed with the test
# fixtures converted to the presets.
#
# prolog_backend_preset              the knowledge a library is compiled from
# prolog_backend_type_check          the knowledge of the type-check round,
#                                    the backend's shapes always with it, so
#                                    that no round enables the type check
#                                    without them
#
# closure_application and occurrence_erasure type no native type and are not
# part of the preset: an entry lists them beside it.
λ export
. (λtuple. tuple λmixin. mixin mixin)
λ omega
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "native_types")
λ native_types
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "native_arithmetic")
λ native_arithmetic
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "hindley_milner_unions")
λ hindley_milner_unions
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "native_arithmetic_unions")
λ native_arithmetic_unions
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "prolog_backend")
λ prolog_backend
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "native_arithmetic_prolog_backend")
λ native_arithmetic_prolog_backend
. omega (omega (omega corpora "compiler") "prolog_backend_shapes")
λ prolog_backend_shapes
. ( λ tuple
    . tuple
      ( prolog_backend_shapes
      + native_arithmetic_prolog_backend
      + prolog_backend
      + native_arithmetic_unions
      + hindley_milner_unions
      + native_arithmetic
      + native_types
      )
  )
λ prolog_backend_preset
. (λtuple. tuple (prolog_backend_shapes + native_arithmetic_unions + hindley_milner_unions))
λ prolog_backend_type_check
. export prolog_backend_preset prolog_backend_type_check
